---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Matt Rabah's background, methodology, and approach to customer experience and operations."
>
  <section class="hero container">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>

    <h1 class="display">The strategy matters. The plumbing makes it real.</h1>

    <div class="lead">
      <p class="about-prose">
        I’m a CX and CRM consultant based in Detroit. I hold a Master's in Customer Experience Management from Michigan State, but academic theory only gets you so far. The real work is making those ideas function in the wild.
      </p>
      <p class="about-prose">
        My approach to business operations is tailored and intentional; I don't believe in high-volume, "spray and pray" tactics. For example, I hold certifications in platforms like Salesforce, but I view them strictly as the infrastructure required to do high-level consultant work. They are the pipes; my job is to figure out where the water needs to go to help your business grow.
      </p>
      <p class="about-prose">
        I thrive in the space where human behavior meets technical execution. When I'm not untangling complex lifecycle systems, I'm usually building AI workflows, transcribing music, or playing my Martin acoustic.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>